      "steps_unavailable": "Prenominal demonstrative. The record's formation is この + noun with no particle and no change to either word (この + 車 = この車). この stands BEFORE its host, while the closed op enum builds a surface by transforming a base and suffixing tokens to it. Encoding this as base=noun would emit the bare noun and silently drop この, so no step list is given.",
      "nuance_tags": [],
      "usage_contexts": [
        "spoken",
        "written"
      ]
    },
